   "title": {
    "zh": "合并，再合并",
    "en": "Merge, and Merge Again"
   },
   "why": {
    "zh": "从窗上的雨滴讲起：最近的两滴总是先合在一起。再看五个朋友分两辆车：每次把最投机的两组合并；一个把 10 排在 2 前面的文件夹，讲清原网页的比较器错误；酒店只有双人房，讲清为什么不能硬凑。",
    "en": "It opens with rain on a window, where the nearest two drops always fuse first. Then five friends split into two cars by merging the best-matched groups; a folder that sorts 10 before 2 explains the original page's comparator bug; twin rooms at the hotel show why you never force a merge."
   },
   "music": {
    "zh": "《We Never (Remix)（若如初见）》Hi Noise / 秋成（第三方录音，不在本课程许可范围内）",
    "en": "“We Never (Remix)” by Hi Noise / 秋成 (third-party recording, not covered by this course's licences)"
   },
