      {
       "start": 0.0,
       "end": 4.6,
       "text": "Rain on a window.",
       "sceneId": "p-drops"
      },
      {
       "start": 4.6,
       "end": 9.2,
       "text": "The two nearest drops fuse first.",
       "sceneId": "p-drops"
      },
      {
       "start": 10.75,
       "end": 16.35,
       "text": "Then the next nearest pair. Merged, never split again.",
       "sceneId": "p-drops2"
      },
      {
       "start": 17.41,
       "end": 21.81,
       "text": "Five friends splitting into two cars can do the same.",
       "sceneId": "p-rule"
      },
      {
       "start": 21.81,
       "end": 26.832,
       "text": "At first everyone is a group of one: 18 in friendships split.",
       "sceneId": "p-rule"
      },
      {
       "start": 26.832,
       "end": 31.632,
       "text": "Merge the two best-matched groups, until two remain.",
       "sceneId": "p-rule"
      },
      {
       "start": 37.0,
       "end": 44.022,
       "text": "Two pairs get along best: Ada–Ben and Dev–Eva, both 5.",
       "sceneId": "p-step1"
      },
      {
       "start": 44.022,
       "end": 50.022,
       "text": "A tie goes by name: A comes before D, so Ada and Ben go first.",
       "sceneId": "p-step1"
      },
      {
       "start": 51.18,
       "end": 58.424,
       "text": "Ada and Ben are one group now. Cai's two lines add up: 1 + 4 = 5.",
       "sceneId": "p-step2"
      },
      {
       "start": 58.424,
       "end": 64.113,
       "text": "Another tie with Dev–Eva; by name, Cai joins them.",
       "sceneId": "p-step2"
      },
      {
       "start": 66.08,
       "end": 71.102,
       "text": "Last, Dev and Eva share a car. Two groups left: stop.",
       "sceneId": "p-step3"
      },
      {
       "start": 73.0,
       "end": 76.244,
       "text": "Ever seen a folder like this?",
       "sceneId": "p-files"
      },
      {
       "start": 76.244,
       "end": 78.822,
       "text": "10 sorts before 2.",
       "sceneId": "p-files"
      },
      {
       "start": 80.16,
       "end": 84.738,
       "text": "As numbers, 2 comes first; as text, 10 does.",
       "sceneId": "p-flip"
      },
      {
       "start": 84.738,
       "end": 88.649,
       "text": "Text compares one character at a time.",
       "sceneId": "p-flip"
      },
      {
       "start": 89.0,
       "end": 94.067,
       "text": "The original page compared its candidates the same way: as text.",
       "sceneId": "p-bug"
      },
      {
       "start": 94.067,
       "end": 100.2,
       "text": "“-1” sorts before “-5”: affinity 1 looked like the best pair.",
       "sceneId": "p-bug"
      },
      {
       "start": 100.2,
       "end": 103.889,
       "text": "The split friendship went from 3 to 9.",
       "sceneId": "p-bug"
      },
      {
       "start": 104.0,
       "end": 108.4,
       "text": "The fix: compare field by field, numbers as numbers.",
       "sceneId": "p-fix"
      },
      {
       "start": 108.4,
       "end": 114.978,
       "text": "This course also tests 10 against 2 and 2.5 against 2, so it is not right by luck.",
       "sceneId": "p-fix"
      },
      {
       "start": 117.14,
       "end": 121.14,
       "text": "At the hotel, every room has two beds.",
       "sceneId": "p-rooms"
      },
      {
       "start": 121.14,
       "end": 125.496,
       "text": "Whichever room Cai joins, it holds three.",
       "sceneId": "p-rooms"
      },
      {
       "start": 127.6,
       "end": 133.0,
       "text": "So it stops at three: no squeezing, no pretending it made two.",
