      {
       "start": 3.4,
       "end": 10.2,
       "text": "从单点出发：每个节点自成一簇，cut 等于全部边权 18。",
       "sceneId": "k01-problem"
      },
      {
       "start": 10.2,
       "end": 14.867,
       "text": "每一步，合并亲和度最大的合法一对。",
       "sceneId": "k01-problem"
      },
      {
       "start": 14.867,
       "end": 19.267,
       "text": "亲和度是两簇之间所有边权之和。",
       "sceneId": "k01-problem"
      },
      {
       "start": 19.267,
       "end": 23.844,
       "text": "达到 K，或者没有合法的一对，就停。",
       "sceneId": "k01-problem"
      },
      {
       "start": 24.244,
       "end": 28.378,
       "text": "第一步：A–B 和 D–E 都是 5。",
       "sceneId": "k02-step1"
      },
      {
       "start": 28.378,
       "end": 32.733,
       "text": "平票按名字：A 在 D 前，选 A–B。",
       "sceneId": "k02-step1"
      },
      {
       "start": 32.733,
       "end": 35.978,
       "text": "cut 从 18 降到 13。",
       "sceneId": "k02-step1"
      },
      {
       "start": 36.378,
       "end": 39.444,
       "text": "A、B 收缩成一簇。",
       "sceneId": "k03-step2"
      },
      {
       "start": 39.444,
       "end": 50.022,
       "text": "AB 和 C 之间有两根线：1 + 4 = 5，又和 D–E 平票；按成员 [A, B] < [D]，选 AB–C。",
       "sceneId": "k03-step2"
      },
      {
       "start": 50.022,
       "end": 53.044,
       "text": "cut 从 13 降到 8。",
       "sceneId": "k03-step2"
      },
      {
       "start": 53.444,
       "end": 56.022,
       "text": "第三步：D–E。",
       "sceneId": "k04-step3"
      },
      {
       "start": 56.022,
       "end": 57.933,
       "text": "合并它们。",
       "sceneId": "k04-step3"
      },
      {
       "start": 57.933,
       "end": 62.733,
       "text": "剩两簇，停：ABC | DE，cut 3。",
       "sceneId": "k04-step3"
      },
      {
       "start": 62.733,
       "end": 67.756,
       "text": "每次合并，cut 恰好下降这次的亲和度。",
       "sceneId": "k04-step3"
      },
      {
       "start": 68.156,
       "end": 72.756,
       "text": "原网页用小于号直接比较数组。",
       "sceneId": "k05-bug"
      },
      {
       "start": 72.756,
       "end": 80.667,
       "text": "JavaScript 先把数组转成字符串：“-1” 排在 “-5” 前。",
       "sceneId": "k05-bug"
      },
      {
       "start": 80.667,
       "end": 83.667,
       "text": "四个配置全部算错。",
       "sceneId": "k05-bug"
      },
      {
       "start": 83.667,
       "end": 87.933,
       "text": "修正：逐字段比较，数字按数值。",
       "sceneId": "k05-bug"
      },
      {
       "start": 88.333,
       "end": 94.467,
       "text": "容量 2：AB 加 C 是 3 个，被阻止，转而合并 D–E。",
       "sceneId": "k06-capacity"
      },
      {
       "start": 94.467,
