       "start": 3.4,
       "end": 10.2,
       "text": "Start from single nodes: each is its own cluster, and the cut is all 18 of the weight.",
       "sceneId": "k01-problem"
      },
      {
       "start": 10.2,
       "end": 14.867,
       "text": "Each step merges the legal pair with the highest affinity.",
       "sceneId": "k01-problem"
      },
      {
       "start": 14.867,
       "end": 19.267,
       "text": "Affinity is the total weight between the two clusters.",
       "sceneId": "k01-problem"
      },
      {
       "start": 19.267,
       "end": 23.844,
       "text": "Stop when K is reached, or no legal pair remains.",
       "sceneId": "k01-problem"
      },
      {
       "start": 24.244,
       "end": 28.378,
       "text": "Step one: A–B and D–E both score 5.",
       "sceneId": "k02-step1"
      },
      {
       "start": 28.378,
       "end": 32.733,
       "text": "A tie goes by name: A before D, so A–B.",
       "sceneId": "k02-step1"
      },
      {
       "start": 32.733,
       "end": 35.978,
       "text": "The cut drops from 18 to 13.",
       "sceneId": "k02-step1"
      },
      {
       "start": 36.378,
       "end": 39.444,
       "text": "A and B contract into one cluster.",
       "sceneId": "k03-step2"
      },
      {
       "start": 39.444,
       "end": 50.022,
       "text": "AB and C share two wires, 1 + 4 = 5, tying D–E again; by members [A, B] < [D], so AB–C.",
       "sceneId": "k03-step2"
      },
      {
       "start": 50.022,
       "end": 53.044,
       "text": "The cut drops from 13 to 8.",
       "sceneId": "k03-step2"
      },
      {
       "start": 53.444,
       "end": 56.022,
       "text": "Step three: D–E.",
       "sceneId": "k04-step3"
      },
      {
       "start": 56.022,
       "end": 57.933,
       "text": "Merge them.",
       "sceneId": "k04-step3"
      },
      {
       "start": 57.933,
       "end": 62.733,
       "text": "Two clusters left, stop: ABC | DE, cut 3.",
       "sceneId": "k04-step3"
      },
      {
       "start": 62.733,
       "end": 67.756,
       "text": "Every merge lowers the cut by exactly its affinity.",
       "sceneId": "k04-step3"
      },
      {
       "start": 68.156,
       "end": 72.756,
       "text": "The original page compared arrays with a plain less-than.",
       "sceneId": "k05-bug"
      },
      {
