       "text": "All four settings came out wrong.",
       "sceneId": "k05-bug"
      },
      {
       "start": 83.667,
       "end": 87.933,
       "text": "The fix: compare field by field, numbers as numbers.",
       "sceneId": "k05-bug"
      },
      {
       "start": 88.333,
       "end": 94.467,
       "text": "Capacity 2: AB plus C is 3, blocked, so D–E merges instead.",
       "sceneId": "k06-capacity"
      },
      {
       "start": 94.467,
       "end": 98.467,
       "text": "After that, both candidates exceed the capacity.",
       "sceneId": "k06-capacity"
      },
      {
       "start": 98.467,
       "end": 103.711,
       "text": "It stops at 3 clusters, cut 8: legal, but K is not reached.",
       "sceneId": "k06-capacity"
      },
      {
       "start": 104.111,
       "end": 106.244,
       "text": "Four things to keep.",
       "sceneId": "k07-take"
      },
      {
       "start": 106.244,
       "end": 110.711,
       "text": "Merge the legal pair with the most weight between them;",
       "sceneId": "k07-take"
      },
      {
       "start": 110.711,
       "end": 114.178,
       "text": "ties by name, field by field;",
       "sceneId": "k07-take"
      },
      {
       "start": 114.178,
       "end": 122.311,
       "text": "the cut drops by each affinity; with no legal pair, stop. Try it in the lab below.",
       "sceneId": "k07-take"
