     "transcript": [
      {
       "start": 3.4,
       "end": 8.067,
       "text": "The cut is the total weight of the wires between clusters.",
       "sceneId": "a01-drop"
      },
      {
       "start": 8.067,
       "end": 13.333,
       "text": "Merge P and Q, and only the wires between them become inside wires.",
       "sceneId": "a01-drop"
      },
      {
       "start": 13.333,
       "end": 19.244,
       "text": "Nothing else changes, so the cut drops by exactly the affinity of P and Q.",
       "sceneId": "a01-drop"
      },
      {
       "start": 19.244,
       "end": 28.267,
       "text": "Taking the highest affinity makes the cut fall the most at each step: steepest descent, with no global guarantee.",
       "sceneId": "a01-drop"
      },
      {
       "start": 28.667,
       "end": 32.8,
       "text": "Using a sum as the affinity has a side effect.",
       "sceneId": "a02-snow"
      },
      {
       "start": 32.8,
       "end": 40.933,
       "text": "ABC and D share three thin wires, 3 in all, beating E–F's 2; as an average it is only 1.",
       "sceneId": "a02-snow"
      },
      {
       "start": 40.933,
       "end": 44.178,
       "text": "On the 24-cell circuit:",
       "sceneId": "a02-snow"
      },
      {
       "start": 44.178,
       "end": 49.444,
       "text": "the first 7 steps all feed the same cluster. Big clusters snowball.",
       "sceneId": "a02-snow"
      },
      {
       "start": 49.844,
       "end": 56.644,
       "text": "Comparing selection keys: a tuple compares field by field, and the first field settles it.",
       "sceneId": "a03-compare"
      },
      {
       "start": 56.644,
       "end": 65.0,
       "text": "A string only sees characters: the second character “1” decides, and 10 versus 9 is never asked.",
       "sceneId": "a03-compare"
      },
      {
       "start": 65.0,
       "end": 74.467,
       "text": "JavaScript's default sort() does the same: 10, 9, 2 becomes 10, 2, 9.",
       "sceneId": "a03-compare"
      },
      {
       "start": 74.867,
       "end": 79.667,
       "text": "No capacity, K = 2: legal, and K is reached.",
       "sceneId": "a04-states"
      },
      {
       "start": 79.667,
       "end": 85.356,
       "text": "Capacity 2: legal, but the positive pairs left are all over capacity.",
       "sceneId": "a04-states"
      },
      {
       "start": 85.356,
       "end": 90.689,
       "text": "A disconnected graph: no wire at all between the remaining clusters.",
       "sceneId": "a04-states"
      },
      {
       "start": 90.689,
       "end": 95.822,
       "text": "Report all three separately, and stop when no legal pair remains.",
       "sceneId": "a04-states"
      },
      {
       "start": 96.222,
       "end": 103.244,
       "text": "Greedy never backtracks. Module 04 has an example: capacity 2, K = 2.",
       "sceneId": "a05-noback"
      },
      {
       "start": 103.244,
       "end": 110.933,
       "text": "A–B goes first, the largest at 10; C and D are left together, cut 18.",
       "sceneId": "a05-noback"
      },
      {
       "start": 110.933,
       "end": 115.067,
       "text": "Yet AC | BD has a cut of only 11.",
       "sceneId": "a05-noback"
      },
      {
       "start": 115.067,
       "end": 121.422,
       "text": "The best first step left only bad choices. The next module is about exactly this.",
       "sceneId": "a05-noback"
      },
      {
       "start": 121.822,
       "end": 126.622,
       "text": "Cost: merge a 12×12 grid down to 2 clusters.",
       "sceneId": "a06-cost"
      },
      {
       "start": 126.622,
       "end": 134.889,
       "text": "Recomputing every pair each step costs about 7 times as much as updating only the pairs next to the new cluster.",
       "sceneId": "a06-cost"
      },
      {
       "start": 134.889,
       "end": 141.689,
       "text": "Because no other pair's affinity changed: use a priority queue and update only those few.",
       "sceneId": "a06-cost"
      },
      {
       "start": 142.089,
       "end": 144.156,
       "text": "Six things to keep.",
       "sceneId": "a07-summary"
      },
      {
       "start": 157.156,
       "end": 160.4,
       "text": "Next: capacity takes centre stage.",
       "sceneId": "a07-summary"
